            <title>红魔游戏平板 5 Pro 游戏适配进度更新，主流 FPS 游戏 165Hz 高刷全面上线</title>
            <link>https://www.ithome.com/0/990/838.htm</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ithome.com/0/990/838.htm</guid>
            <pubDate></pubDate>
